# Lab

`src/lab/` holds parked prototypes (e.g. `FillHeadline`, `NameGlobe`, `FeatureCardRow`). **Not imported by routes.**

- Don’t “fix” lab code into pages unless the user asks to revive something.
- To ship a lab piece: move it into the right `src/features/` folder and wire a page; update rules/runbooks.
- Safe to delete if confirmed unused.
